# Allow-list: the build stage reads only the Go module and its sources.
# Everything else (git history, CI config, local tool state, secrets a
# developer may have lying around) stays out of the build context.
# Without .git the binary carries no Go VCS stamp (`go version -m` shows
# "(devel)"); the version comes from the -ldflags in the Dockerfile.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
**/*_test.go
